(text "Sensoren, RTC und EEPROM" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22 936.48 0) (effects (font (size 4 4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "65cb3781-d784-4785-b773-143cdafd92f5"))
(text "Befestigung" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 22 1109.18 0) (effects (font (size 4 4) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "82d644a0-546b-4021-a832-127aad255647"))
(text "Entwurf V3: Umbau von V2 auf ESP32-S3-WROOM-1, erzeugt aus der V2-Netzliste (kicad-cli)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1208.18 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "efcbd210-d7d9-4f5d-abe8-383ad300cf2f"))
(text "Entfallen gegenueber V2: STM32F411 (U2), ESP-12F (U4), Quarz X1 samt Lastkondensatoren, VDDA-Filter, SWD-Stecker H3, Umschalter SW4, Boot-Widerstaende des ESP8266." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1214.18 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d2197a94-28c3-4714-8cdc-5165aa2204bb"))
(text "Neu: ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 (U2), USB-C 16P mit D+/D- (USB1), ESD-Schutz U11, BOOT-Taste SW5 mit Pull-up R32, Abblockung C30/C31, ADC-Filter C32." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1220.18 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9b15dfb3-bcce-466a-837a-026a523f5cd1"))
(text "Geaendert: C1 = 1 uF (EN-Verzoegerung, bewusste Abweichung von V2: dort 100 nF, LCSC C28323), H6 = UART0-Konsole." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1226.18 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "722068fc-45e0-4724-b1d3-501dd83ccf03"))
(text "Unveraendert: Versorgung, 3,3-V-ODER-Schaltung (D2/D3), LED-Pfad (U3, Q1, Q2), LDR-Pfad (R22 = 1 kOhm wie V2), RTC, EEPROM, DS18B20, Taster, Test-Pads." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1232.18 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "620b4bcb-efb8-4e4d-859a-e86006b11599"))
(text "Noch nicht geprueft: Footprints neuer Teile gegen die Bestueckung, 3,3-V-Reserve des SY8301, Platzierung der Antenne." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25 1238.18 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "fac87224-cbbc-471d-a360-ec9e4356e105"))
